          </span>
        </a>

        <a class="vinyl-card playlist-card" href="https://open.spotify.com/playlist/6FsScqbSTKOJnfCauIFtxQ" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
          <span class="spotify-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24" fill="#fff"><path d="M12 2C6.48 2 2 6.48 2 12s4.48 10 10 10 10-4.48 10-10S17.52 2 12 2zm4.59 14.42a.62.62 0 0 1-.86.21c-2.35-1.44-5.3-1.76-8.79-.96a.62.62 0 1 1-.28-1.21c3.81-.87 7.08-.5 9.72 1.1a.62.62 0 0 1 .21.86zm1.23-2.74a.78.78 0 0 1-1.07.26c-2.69-1.65-6.79-2.13-9.97-1.17a.78.78 0 1 1-.45-1.49c3.63-1.1 8.15-.56 11.24 1.33a.78.78 0 0 1 .25 1.07zm.1-2.85C14.83 8.96 9.4 8.78 6.3 9.72a.93.93 0 1 1-.54-1.78c3.56-1.08 9.56-.87 13.33 1.36a.93.93 0 0 1-.95 1.60z"/></svg>
          </span>
          <span class="vinyl-meta">
            <span class="playlist-name">yeh unn dino ki baat🌙</span>
            <span class="playlist-caption">// soundtrack of a show I never watched, but the songs found me anyway</span>
          </span>
          <span class="playlist-meta">27 songs · 2hr 30min</span>
          <span class="playlist-preview" aria-hidden="true">
            <iframe data-testid="embed-iframe" style="border-radius:12px" src="https://open.spotify.com/embed/playlist/6FsScqbSTKOJnfCauIFtxQ?utm_source=generator&si=8e5025cc1d774a4b" width="75%" height="352" frameborder="0" allowfullscreen="" allow="autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; fullscreen; picture-in-picture" loading="lazy"></iframe>
          </span>
        </a>

        <a class="vinyl-card playlist-card" href="https://open.spotify.com/playlist/38nsGjIuZgVzxEmf4NpxeN" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
          <span class="spotify-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24" fill="#fff"><path d="M12 2C6.48 2 2 6.48 2 12s4.48 10 10 10 10-4.48 10-10S17.52 2 12 2zm4.59 14.42a.62.62 0 0 1-.86.21c-2.35-1.44-5.3-1.76-8.79-.96a.62.62 0 1 1-.28-1.21c3.81-.87 7.08-.5 9.72 1.1a.62.62 0 0 1 .21.86zm1.23-2.74a.78.78 0 0 1-1.07.26c-2.69-1.65-6.79-2.13-9.97-1.17a.78.78 0 1 1-.45-1.49c3.63-1.1 8.15-.56 11.24 1.33a.78.78 0 0 1 .25 1.07zm.1-2.85C14.83 8.96 9.4 8.78 6.3 9.72a.93.93 0 1 1-.54-1.78c3.56-1.08 9.56-.87 13.33 1.36a.93.93 0 0 1-.95 1.60z"/></svg>
          </span>
          <span class="vinyl-meta">
            <span class="playlist-name">♟️</span>
            <span class="playlist-caption">// unlabeled on purpose</span>
          </span>
          <span class="playlist-meta">100 songs</span>
          <span class="playlist-preview" aria-hidden="true">
            <iframe data-testid="embed-iframe" style="border-radius:12px" src="https://open.spotify.com/embed/playlist/38nsGjIuZgVzxEmf4NpxeN?utm_source=generator&si=8b2dbc5aa388471d" width="75%" height="352" frameborder="0" allowfullscreen="" allow="autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; fullscreen; picture-in-picture" loading="lazy"></iframe>
          </span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- RANDOM FACTS -->
    <section class="facts-section reveal" aria-label="A few off-duty facts">
      <div class="term">
        <div class="term-line">
          <span class="term-prompt">$</span>
          <span class="term-cmd">cat random-facts.txt</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <ul class="hobby-fact-list">
        <li>I hear a song once and it stays stuck for the whole week.</li>
        <li>Half the photos I keep are of nothing in particular.</li>
        <li>I judge a city by how walkable its streets are.</li>
        <li>The best ideas show up after midnight, mid-shower.</li>
        <li>Music is rarely ever paused in one of my tabs.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

  </div>
</section>